    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721820/extras/0019fff34fde82fb90c0d1eae6769b4c.poster.avif?t=1748304668\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721820/extras/0019fff34fde82fb90c0d1eae6769b4c.webm?t=1748304668\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721820/extras/0019fff34fde82fb90c0d1eae6769b4c.mp4?t=1748304668\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>The quirky tale of a lost robot on a huge adventure!<br><br>Play as a headless robot named JEFF-3 on his quest to escape the chaotic Industrial Megacenter. Navigate your clumsy body through bizarre obstacles, solve mind-boggling problems, and overcome head-twisting laws of physics all from the eyes of your detached head!<br><br>Erase what you know about perspective and prepare for hilarious failures in your quest to get your head on straight!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721820/extras/78cf189b55d086268044db1001ed2ec5.poster.avif?t=1748304668\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721820/extras/78cf189b55d086268044db1001ed2ec5.webm?t=1748304668\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721820/extras/e8d010f3f8c3dca87b2e1e2c5e1c0429.poster.avif?t=1748304668\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721820/extras/e8d010f3f8c3dca87b2e1e2c5e1c0429.webm?t=1748304668\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721820/extras/e8d010f3f8c3dca87b2e1e2c5e1c0429.mp4?t=1748304668\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Headless JEFF-3 offers a unique take on an under-utilized concept in 2nd-person perspective. Everything is viewed from JEFF-3\u2019s detached head, and the body is separate from the head. You are, essentially, seeing yourself!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721820/extras/1ef089dc3b02380df7aa05ee97f078aa.poster.avif?t=1748304668\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721820/extras/1ef089dc3b02380df7aa05ee97f078aa.webm?t=1748304668\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721820/extras/e4314bf000f501f35c634d0dd2984957.poster.avif?t=1748304668\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721820/extras/e4314bf000f501f35c634d0dd2984957.webm?t=1748304668\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721820/extras/e4314bf000f501f35c634d0dd2984957.mp4?t=1748304668\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Your head is both a tool of knowledge and a moveable camera. Play around with different angles and views by picking up your head and tossing it around different areas of the factory. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721820/extras/83fc1764b7aecc40c3a7ffbf6124c5c2.poster.avif?t=1748304668\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721820/extras/83fc1764b7aecc40c3a7ffbf6124c5c2.webm?t=1748304668\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721820/extras/83fc1764b7aecc40c3a7ffbf6124c5c2.mp4?t=1748304668\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Interact with conveyor belts, throw crates around, avoid hazards, and poke your brain with solutions to overcome complex puzzles.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721820/extras/287cbc2276323f2f1ba3dc62ef77d930.poster.avif?t=1748304668\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721820/extras/287cbc2276323f2f1ba3dc62ef77d930.webm?t=1748304668\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721820/extras/287cbc2276323f2f1ba3dc62ef77d930.mp4?t=1748304668\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>You also have access to security cameras that are scattered around the Industrial Megacenter. Use them to view hard-to-reach areas when your body goes out of sight.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721820/extras/b14ca6af1b69c7a475a2ea44e5e00e05.poster.avif?t=1748304668\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721820/extras/b14ca6af1b69c7a475a2ea44e5e00e05.webm?t=1748304668\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br><strong>MAIN STORY -</strong> 12 x 4 chapters for 48 levels of fun and puzzle-solving action!<br><br><strong>MULTIPLAYER -</strong> Explore the Megacenter together in Co-Op play... but be warned, two heads, twice the chaos!<br><br><strong>LEVEN EDITOR -</strong> Steam Workshop compatible level editor. Share, build and challenge the online community with your custom content",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721820/extras/0019fff34fde82fb90c0d1eae6769b4c.poster.avif?t=1748304668\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721820/extras/0019fff34fde82fb90c0d1eae6769b4c.webm?t=1748304668\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721820/extras/0019fff34fde82fb90c0d1eae6769b4c.mp4?t=1748304668\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>The quirky tale of a lost robot on a huge adventure!<br><br>Play as a headless robot named JEFF-3 on his quest to escape the chaotic Industrial Megacenter. Navigate your clumsy body through bizarre obstacles, solve mind-boggling problems, and overcome head-twisting laws of physics all from the eyes of your detached head!<br><br>Erase what you know about perspective and prepare for hilarious failures in your quest to get your head on straight!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721820/extras/78cf189b55d086268044db1001ed2ec5.poster.avif?t=1748304668\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721820/extras/78cf189b55d086268044db1001ed2ec5.webm?t=1748304668\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721820/extras/e8d010f3f8c3dca87b2e1e2c5e1c0429.poster.avif?t=1748304668\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721820/extras/e8d010f3f8c3dca87b2e1e2c5e1c0429.webm?t=1748304668\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721820/extras/e8d010f3f8c3dca87b2e1e2c5e1c0429.mp4?t=1748304668\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Headless JEFF-3 offers a unique take on an under-utilized concept in 2nd-person perspective. Everything is viewed from JEFF-3\u2019s detached head, and the body is separate from the head. You are, essentially, seeing yourself!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721820/extras/1ef089dc3b02380df7aa05ee97f078aa.poster.avif?t=1748304668\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721820/extras/1ef089dc3b02380df7aa05ee97f078aa.webm?t=1748304668\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721820/extras/e4314bf000f501f35c634d0dd2984957.poster.avif?t=1748304668\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721820/extras/e4314bf000f501f35c634d0dd2984957.webm?t=1748304668\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721820/extras/e4314bf000f501f35c634d0dd2984957.mp4?t=1748304668\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Your head is both a tool of knowledge and a moveable camera. Play around with different angles and views by picking up your head and tossing it around different areas of the factory. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721820/extras/83fc1764b7aecc40c3a7ffbf6124c5c2.poster.avif?t=1748304668\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721820/extras/83fc1764b7aecc40c3a7ffbf6124c5c2.webm?t=1748304668\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721820/extras/83fc1764b7aecc40c3a7ffbf6124c5c2.mp4?t=1748304668\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Interact with conveyor belts, throw crates around, avoid hazards, and poke your brain with solutions to overcome complex puzzles.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721820/extras/287cbc2276323f2f1ba3dc62ef77d930.poster.avif?t=1748304668\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721820/extras/287cbc2276323f2f1ba3dc62ef77d930.webm?t=1748304668\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721820/extras/287cbc2276323f2f1ba3dc62ef77d930.mp4?t=1748304668\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>You also have access to security cameras that are scattered around the Industrial Megacenter. Use them to view hard-to-reach areas when your body goes out of sight.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721820/extras/b14ca6af1b69c7a475a2ea44e5e00e05.poster.avif?t=1748304668\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721820/extras/b14ca6af1b69c7a475a2ea44e5e00e05.webm?t=1748304668\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br><strong>MAIN STORY -</strong> 12 x 4 chapters for 48 levels of fun and puzzle-solving action!<br><br><strong>MULTIPLAYER -</strong> Explore the Megacenter together in Co-Op play... but be warned, two heads, twice the chaos!<br><br><strong>LEVEN EDITOR -</strong> Steam Workshop compatible level editor. Share, build and challenge the online community with your custom content",
